OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Swerving drink-driver
OL,4,Acrashes into wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drink-driver who crashed into a wall
OL,7,Fhas been banned from driving for 22
OL,8,Fmonths and ordered to pay more than
OL,9,F#700 in fines and court costs.
OL,11,FSusan Posarsek, 50, from Long
OL,12,FWittenham, Oxfordshire, was sentenced
OL,13,Fat Oxford Magistrates' Court earlier
OL,14,Fthis month after previously pleading
OL,15,Fguilty to drink-driving.
OL,17,FThames Valley Police she had been
OL,18,Fheading home after spending the
OL,19,Fafternoon drinking in Abingdon on 26
OL,20,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
